 take on the military and other Kaiju that dare threaten you.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS A KAIJU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras/3017d6fc7a59e729b74a453446abd1b1.avif?t=1770918429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras_big/3017d6fc7a59e729b74a453446abd1b1.avif?t=1770918429 width=800 height=450 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself as one of three unique kaiju, Excidio, Golem or Raijin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS-BASED DESTRUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras/80225fe030c778d9c732a764a9dc2d3e.poster.avif?t=1770918429\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras/80225fe030c778d9c732a764a9dc2d3e.webm?t=1770918429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras/80225fe030c778d9c732a764a9dc2d3e.mp4?t=1770918429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully physics-based realistic destruction. Walk through buildings only leaving rubble behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY 4 UNIQUE CITIES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras/1c9f3f0a19c0afd889f50a6bf655493b.avif?t=1770918429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594130/extras_big/1c9f3f0a19c0afd889f50a6bf655493b.avif?t=1770918429 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on a variety of unique maps inspired by real locations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_